            "reverted_by": "SarahB",
            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "#Don’t touch anything metal or electrical. Using a landline phone is the main cause of lightning-related injuries in the US. Lightning can travel into the home from through any material that conducts electricity. This includes landlines, electrical wiring, and plumbing.[[Image:Protect Yourself in a Thunderstorm Step 3.jpg|center]]"
                ],
