                "removed": [
                    "{{fa}}[[Image:Thunderstorm over Chesapeake Bay 9534.jpg|thumb|]]Lightning is a beautiful and inspiring phenomenon, but it can be deadly.  Over the past 30 years, lightning has killed an average of 67 people per year in the U.S.A alone.  Fortunately, most lightning-related deaths are preventable.  Follow these steps to safety the next time there’s fire in the sky.",
