            "reverted_by": "Harri",
            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "*Lightning dose not only happen during thunderstorms; it can also happen during volcanic eruptions. So you should also know about volcano safety and lightning safety. The more ash there is the more likely lightning will strike."
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "*Lightning dose not only happen during thunderstorms, it can also happen during volcanic eruptions.Meaning you should additionally take a mix of volcano safety and lightning safety judging by the amount of ash (the more ash there is the more likely lightning will strike)."
                ]
            }
        },
