                "removed": [
                    "Thunderstorms are fun to watch, but as you know are very dangerous. you should know how to protect you AND your family during or before a thunderstorm. so here are the steps and tips on how to do this.",
                    "# if you are outside(in general)or in the water, get inside into a sturdy building.(note: most public outdoor recreation parks have Lightning Warning Horns that will sound if lightning is nearby, 1 long blast=emergency and 3 short blasts=all clear).",
                    "# bring furniture and pets inside.",
                    "*don't use water",
                    "*unplug electric appliances(a power failure can blow those device)",
                    "*have candles, water and flashlight's ready",
                    "*one warning is that you should never ignore warnings wether by sirens, radio or TV they are there to protect you."
                ]
