            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "#Once in a suitable shelter, you still need to take some extra precautions.  Do not touch land-line phones, plugged-in electrical appliances, or door knobs; keep your distance from electrical or plumbing fixtures, electrical sockets, windows, and doors.  Keep windows closed (this is especially important in a vehicle), and try to stay within inner rooms of the structure.  Stay out of the bathtub or shower, and avoid indoor swimming pools.  In a car, try to avoid touching any part of the metal frame or the car's glass.  In short, stay away from anything that may directly conduct electricity in the event of a strike."
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "#Once in a suitable shelter, you still need to take some extra precautions.  Do not touch land-line phones, plugged-in electrical appliances, or door knobs; keep your distance from electrical or plumbing fixtures, giant wooden dildos, electrical sockets, windows, and doors.  Keep windows closed (this is especially important in a vehicle), and try to stay within inner rooms of the structure.  Stay out of the bathtub or shower, and avoid indoor swimming pools.  In a car, try to avoid touching any part of the metal frame or the car's glass.  In short, stay away from anything that may directly conduct electricity in the event of a strike."
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "4873278",
            "user": "64.223.181.45",
            "timestamp": "04:36, 29 July 2010",
            "anon": true,
            "size": "(10,420 bytes)",
            "change": 157,
            "summary": "(→‎Steps)",
            "is_minor": false,
            "is_expert": false,
            "status": "active",
            "contribution_type": "addition",
            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "#Once in a suitable shelter, you still need to take some extra precautions.  Do not touch land-line phones, plugged-in electrical appliances, or door knobs; keep your distance from electrical or plumbing fixtures, giant wooden dildos, electrical sockets, windows, and doors.  Keep windows closed (this is especially important in a vehicle), and try to stay within inner rooms of the structure.  Stay out of the bathtub or shower, and avoid indoor swimming pools.  In a car, try to avoid touching any part of the metal frame or the car's glass.  In short, stay away from anything that may directly conduct electricity in the event of a strike.",
                    "#'''If there is absolutely no shelter, squat on the ground, with as little parts as possible touching the ground, and your feet close together. Do not lie down as this will provide a bigger target for the lightning to strike. However, if the victim has no pulse, the AED will be rendered useless, as it uses electric pulses to correct irregular heartbeats only."
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "#Once in a suitable shelter, you still need to take some extra precautions.  Do not touch land-line phones, plugged-in electrical appliances, or door knobs; keep your distance from electrical or plumbing fixtures, electrical sockets, windows, and doors.  Keep windows closed (this is especially important in a vehicle), and try to stay within inner rooms of the structure.  Stay out of the bathtub or shower, and avoid indoor swimming pools.  In a car, try to avoid touching any part of the metal frame or the car's glass.  In short, stay away from anything that may directly conduct electricity in the event of a strike.",
                    "#'''If there is absolutely no shelter, squat on the ground, with as little parts as possible touching the ground, and your feet close together. Do not lie down as this will provide a bigger target for the lightning to strike."
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "4830997",
            "user": "W2TMN",
            "timestamp": "18:55, 18 July 2010",
            "anon": false,
            "size": "(10,263 bytes)",
            "change": -1660,
            "summary": "(Reverted edits by 95.209.166.17 (Talk); changed back to last version by Tryme2)",
            "is_minor": true,
            "is_expert": false,
            "status": "active",
            "contribution_type": "revert",
            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "*Wearing portable electronics with headphones during a lightning storm can increase the likelihood of severe injury in the case of a strike - not only to the ears, but to anywhere on the body that the headphone cables lay against."
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "*Wearing portable electronics with headphones during a lightning storm can increase the likelihood of severe injury in the case of a strike - not only to the ears, but to anywhere on the body that the headphone cables lay against. A good tip is to protect themselves in the car",
                    "*Åska är vanligt på sommaren i stora delar av USA Central Florida får mest blixtnedslag per kvadratkilometer per år. Vid vissa tider på året , Klippiga bergen i Colorado få en lika stort antal strejker.",
                    "*Metal faktiskt inte locka blixtnedslag, som är en vanlig uppfattning . Istället gör det el i händelse av en strejk. För att vara säker, ta bort alla metallföremål från kroppen. Detta omfattar bälte spännen , knäppen bh och underwires , örhängen , klockor och små förändringar i dina fickor .",
                    "*Små båtar är farliga platser att vara i ett åskväder . Om du inte kan ta sig till stranden, dock inte in i vattnet - kvar i båten , även om det är en öppen segelbåt med en mast . Det är en felaktig tro på att vara i vattnet är säkrare, men blixten kan lika gärna slå vatten (eller den elektriska laddningen kan utföras genom vatten ) , och om du är drabbade och blir medvetslös , vill du inte vara i vattnet.",
                    "*Åska kan färdas flera meter i marken , så avstånd själv från höga, enstaka objekt. Genom samma resonemang , vara medveten om att en person kan ha träffats av blixten , även om du inte ser blixten träffar personen.",
                    "*Kommersiella blixtnedslag detektorer och vädertjänster varning är tillgängliga och bör övervägas för användning av golfbanor , parker etc.",
                    "*gummi - sulor stövlar gör inget för att skydda dig mot blixtnedslag.",
                    "*Sedan blixtnedslag kan och har blåsa ut kraftsystem , köper och använder \"Self Powered Radios \"och\" Self Powered Ficklampor \" , stänger ljus, så att du har SAFE ljus och info. i händelse av ett strömavbrott."
                ]
            }
        },
